Description: Command-line tool for QMK keyboards over raw HID
 qmk_hid talks to keyboards running the QMK firmware through their raw
 HID interface: it reads the firmware version and sets the RGB lighting
 (colour, brightness, effect), among other commands. Framework makes it
 for the keyboard modules of the Framework Laptop 16.
 .
 The Oaxaca installer installs this package on a Framework Laptop
 16, and the desktop themes the keyboard lighting with it.
